  "description": "When you’ve got young riders on your squad that are literally changing the game, you feel a responsibility to do the same when it comes to the parts they take to the field. That’s why we continue to craft lighter, stronger, discipline-specific frames, forks and bars that allow these groms to redefine what’s possible. Our newest FIT AM18 features an engraved headtube, lighter tubing and a park/freestyle-oriented geometry (check out the SQUIB if you are after a smaller trail rig). At 4 pounds, the AM 18 is half a pound lighter than our last USA-made 18” frame. Little bikes, big moves!",
